  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  subtitleText: {fileID: 203794469}
  _trackKeys:
  - MCVL_Handscan_Complete
  - Ins_Plut1
  - Ins_Plut2
  - Ins_Plut3
  - MCVL_3rd_Inc_WorldMap
  - Ins_Antenna
  - Radio_Advertisement_1
  - Radio_Advertisement_2
  _trackData:
  - 0|4|I heard they burnt off their fingerprints with the machinery.
  - 0|4|Hmm! God I love pizza.
  - 0|4|HOLY! That thing was burning HOT!
  - 0|4|HEHEHE, now I can launch some nukes.
  - 0|4|I should read the manual more often.
  - 0|3|Nice, UNLIMITED POWEEER!!!
  - "0|2|Is your antenna working?\n1|1|It is?!\n2|3|Weeell... can it go through walls?\n3|2|Yeah,
    I didnt think so!\n4|3|Our antennas are the best on the market.\n5|1|No doubt
    about it!\n6|5|I bet you'd like to get your hands on these Super Wave Collection\u2122
    dishes, wouldn't ya?\n7|3|Get your own in Fisher's dishes."
  - "0|4|Folks! Ever heard of Tony\u2019s Takeout Pizzas?!\n1|1|Of course you have!\n2|4|We
    have the tastiest mozzarella cheese and rich tomato sauce pies on the market!\n3|1|[Oven
    ding]\n4|3|Just order one and come on by!\n5|3| Don\u2019t forget! 7-2-5 .\n6|3|Tony\u2019s
    Takeout Pizzas! "
